# --- giant_props: track source, not build output ---------------------------
# The pack is 1.3 GB, almost all of it regenerated by `build.py <key> all`.
# Two of those artifacts are provably unstable byte-for-byte even when the
# source has not changed, so tracking them would add a large noisy diff to
# every commit and make "what actually changed" unanswerable:
#   * the Collada exporter stamps wall-clock <created>/<modified> and jitters
#     the last ULP of normals and UVs (positions and topology are exact).
#   * PNG encoding differs between Pillow 10.4.0 (system) and 11.3.0 (venv):
#     byte-unstable, pixel-identical.
# `dist/` is already ignored at line 9.
examples/giant_props/*/mod/
examples/giant_props/*/textures/
examples/giant_props/*/textures_cooked/
examples/giant_props/*/authoring/review/
examples/giant_props/*/authoring/listing/
examples/giant_props/*/authoring/verify/
examples/giant_props/*/authoring/playtest_eye/
examples/giant_props/**/__pycache__/

# local diagnostics, not source
.codex-diagnostics/
